ders the orchestrator acts on, handoff notes, json and yaml parsed as config): narrow the allowed folders to docs/state and docs/design only plus the notes main already treats as routing files, and the extensions to .md .txt .csv .ndjson (drop .json .yaml .yml).\nFinish the git removal properly: after your change, the diff of tools/handbuild.mjs, tools/shell-writes.mjs and tools/self-approval.mjs against main must contain NOTHING that changes how any git command is classified, approved, recorded or denied (compare with the main version of those files and restore every git related hunk); only the file-edit window logic may differ. Read the remaining findings below too if any: dashed git builtins and xcrun are out of scope now because git is unchanged from main.",
